\,n\\ge 2.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Starting with the first term ${a}_{1}=-4,$ we compute the next terms using the recursive formula until we reach the third term.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} & =-4 \\\\ {a}_{2} & =3{a}_{1}-1=3\\cdot (-4)-1=-13 \\\\ {a}_{3} & =3{a}_{2}-1=3\\cdot (-13)-1=-40\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the third term is ${a}_{3}=-40.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-253349/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "516c2e89-2bce-5636-b16d-aa045d9f9c31"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-253349"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186129511 :question/answer-fields 17592186126852] {:db/id "q-253351/selection/ma-v1/b7c1ff80f933b5fae300ae54a01cf20d509914fbd7e102c9dfe248d87301fe0d/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :answer/id #uuid "cf3c0e87-86c9-569c-9b54-21791dffac8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-253351/selection/ma-v1/b7c1ff80f933b5fae300ae54a01cf20d509914fbd7e102c9dfe248d87301fe0d/cee37ae0a2921bd3973a5cb0592c822dbbfafcfefba8d7007910ead797b9112f" :answer/id #uuid "28b99bc5-85b9-5adc-8000-e95b0b1253ef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "48" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-253351/selection/ma-v1/b7c1ff80f933b5fae300ae54a01cf20d509914fbd7e102c9dfe248d87301fe0d/879a225aaf1b8272157c33247ace982b7e338d5701ba0d4d6c31dd38d4da6784" :answer/id #uuid "065ea280-509d-586a-ad25-edeed69796e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "56" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-253351/selection/ma-v1/b7c1ff80f933b5fae300ae54a01cf20d509914fbd7e102c9dfe248d87301fe0d/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" :answer/id #uuid "94660bfb-2590-5cc4-8400-8bad66214db5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-253351/selection/ma-v1/b7c1ff80f933b5fae300ae54a01cf20d509914fbd